## Common Issues

### "CUDA out of memory" during training
Reduce batch size in `configs/default.yaml`:
```yaml
drl:
  batch_size: 128   # Reduce from 256
```

### Google Cluster files not found
Ensure files match pattern `part-????-of-????.csv.gz` in the input directory.
See download instructions at: https://github.com/google/cluster-data

### Results differ slightly from paper
Results will vary slightly across runs due to:
1. Different hardware (GPU model affects floating-point precision)
2. PyTorch version differences
3. Random seed interactions

All differences should be within the reported 95% CI bounds.

